    {
      "subId": "7281303",
      "subQuestName": "Return and appraise the fertilizer situation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728130301": {
            "id": "728130301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler, thank you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130302"
            ]
          },
          "728130302": {
            "id": "728130302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "I was halfway through making the fertilizer when those monsters came charging up out of nowhere...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130303"
            ]
          },
          "728130303": {
            "id": "728130303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "That's so strange... But it's good that you showed up when you did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130304"
            ]
          },
          "728130304": {
            "id": "728130304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It might be because of that pile of fertilizer, you know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130305"
            ]
          },
          "728130305": {
            "id": "728130305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "R—Really? I've heard that this smell is a sign that you might have succeeded.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130306"
            ]
          },
          "728130306": {
            "id": "728130306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Well, in any case, come over here and have a look at the fertilizer. I'll explain as I open it up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130307"
            ]
          },
          "728130307": {
            "id": "728130307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Hold it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130308"
            ]
          },
          "728130308": {
            "id": "728130308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Eh? Mr. Gorou? I wasn't aware that you'd be passing this way today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130309"
            ]
          },
          "728130309": {
            "id": "728130309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "On patrol, Gorou?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130310"
            ]
          },
          "728130310": {
            "id": "728130310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "I... Uh, never mind that first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130311"
            ]
          },
          "728130311": {
            "id": "728130311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Is this pile of... stuff your doing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130312"
            ]
          },
          "728130312": {
            "id": "728130312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Hahaha, yes. This fertilizer was the work of our hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130313"
            ]
          },
          "728130313": {
            "id": "728130313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Mr. Gorou, did you come here to check on the fertilizer as well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130314"
            ]
          },
          "728130314": {
            "id": "728130314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "Hehe, in that case, let's...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130315"
            ]
          },
          "728130315": {
            "id": "728130315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Wait! Hold on a moment. I'm not here for that. Wait, actually, I am... But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130316"
            ]
          },
          "728130316": {
            "id": "728130316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gorou's face is twisting up something awful...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130317"
            ]
          },
          "728130317": {
            "id": "728130317",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's... adjourn to someplace a little further away...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130318"
            ]
          },
          "728130318": {
            "id": "728130318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Alright, let's do that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130319"
            ]
          },
          "728130319": {
            "id": "728130319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "So, Mr. Gorou, why are you here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130320"
            ]
          },
          "728130320": {
            "id": "728130320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Lately, a lot of residents have been complaining of a terrifying stench nearby...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130321"
            ]
          },
          "728130321": {
            "id": "728130321",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "So for safety, I came to investigate, and wound up following the smell all the way here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130322"
            ]
          },
          "728130322": {
            "id": "728130322",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "That's how I found you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130323"
            ]
          },
          "728130323": {
            "id": "728130323",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Iwata, I've heard that you've been researching fertilizer, but the way that you're going about it is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130326"
            ]
          },
          "728130326": {
            "id": "728130326",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Basically. Either way, Iwata, could you please dispose of that fertilizer? We'll try to help you find some other way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130327"
            ]
          },
          "728130327": {
            "id": "728130327",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ookubo Daisuke",
            "text": "Sir! General Gorou!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130328"
            ]
          },
          "728130328": {
            "id": "728130328",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "I'm here. What's happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130329"
            ]
          },
          "728130329": {
            "id": "728130329",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ookubo Daisuke",
            "text": "General, we caught a suspicious person out in the outskirts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130330"
            ]
          },
          "728130330": {
            "id": "728130330",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ookubo Daisuke",
            "text": "She was acting very furtively, calling herself a... fertilizer salesperson, or somesuch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130331"
            ]
          },
          "728130331": {
            "id": "728130331",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ookubo Daisuke",
            "text": "I thought that was awful strange, so I had this person detained. I thought that you might wish to see to her questioning.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130332"
            ]
          },
          "728130332": {
            "id": "728130332",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Fertilizer this, fertilizer that... What is it with me and fertilizer today...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130333"
            ]
          },
          "728130333": {
            "id": "728130333",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "I've got it. I'll be with you shortly. Head back first and help to maintain order.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130334"
            ]
          },
          "728130334": {
            "id": "728130334",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Iwata, please deal with the matter of the fertilizer. We'll discuss this further later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728130335"
            ]
          },
          "728130335": {
            "id": "728130335",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Gorou",
            "text": "Traveler, why don't you come with me?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7281304",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728130401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728130401": {
            "id": "728130401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Iwata",
            "text": "*sigh* Fertilizers are much trickier than I thought..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7281305",
